To use the Virtual Fly Brain Model Context Protocol tool, access it at vfb3-mcp.virtualflybrain.org. For a quick start, use the hosted service, which requires no installation or setup. Alternatively, configure it using JSON. 

```
{
"mcpServers": {
"virtual-fly-brain": {
"type": "http",
"url": "https://vfb3-mcp.virtualflybrain.org",
"tools": ["*"]
}
}
}
```
